{"feed":{"entry":[{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom","xmlns$blogger":"http://schemas.google.com/blogger/2008","xmlns$georss":"http://www.georss.org/georss","xmlns$gd":"http://schemas.google.com/g/2005","xmlns$thr":"http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0","id":{"$t":"tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-6818054921907446479.post-8445343637682773799"},"published":{"$t":"2014-04-07T14:28:00.000+02:00"},"updated":{"$t":"2015-06-01T13:28:39.923+02:00"},"title":{"type":"text","$t":"Informačné tabule Prosné - Zlatý kôň a Uhliská"},"content":{"type":"html","$t":"<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\nDňa 5.4.2014 naše OZ Hradiská spolu s pánom Štefanom Žilovcom <a href=\"http://www.financnecentrum.sk/domov\" target=\"_blank\">(Finančné centrum)</a> zorganizovalo osadenie informačných tabúľ na <a href=\"http://www.hradiska.sk/search/label/Prosn%C3%A9%20-%20Zlat%C3%BD%20k%C3%B4%C5%88\" target=\"_blank\">hrádku púchovskej kultúry Zlatý kôň</a> a na <a href=\"http://www.hradiska.sk/search/label/Prosn%C3%A9%20-%20Keltsk%C3%A9%20obetisko\" target=\"_blank\">obetisku púchovskej kultúry Uhliská.</a> Naše počiatočné obavy o vývoj počasia sa našťastie nenaplnili (boh Taranis zrejme vzhľadom na význam našej akcie prehodnotil svoje pôvodné plány) a my sme mali celý deň príjemné počasie.</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br />\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: center;\"><tbody>\n<tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgMBXr1OGCDiAkmt430Cicbrw_lBrb1xLTY0tb8Ia3at1oGceqPnykW0k6yyGDe-6YFBQ29Cd-BX6OspPTlVDf_QbGC9_RZv_Uhu7DBkN053zoQ-ahRXLVaVfqgEEqJZdCnnR7TJWzv1gw/s1600/tabu%C4%BEa+k%C3%B4%C5%88+mapa.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"206\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgMBXr1OGCDiAkmt430Cicbrw_lBrb1xLTY0tb8Ia3at1oGceqPnykW0k6yyGDe-6YFBQ29Cd-BX6OspPTlVDf_QbGC9_RZv_Uhu7DBkN053zoQ-ahRXLVaVfqgEEqJZdCnnR7TJWzv1gw/s1600/tabu%C4%BEa+k%C3%B4%C5%88+mapa.JPG\" width=\"320\" /></a></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"tr-caption\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Vyznačené miesto, kde sme umiestnili tabuľu</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<br /></div>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: center;\"><tbody>\n<tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEggPxRFnAsiMhaQeO2MW59CAtuDz4_x8NucSa5QiCKxKLNv3zq_wtvum_ahdukCZpPV7qkDoYRoPrMLfEKnksTiRIqwSektdzl_OyAuTg1otzvs3kHNLpCExEJ5hRTV9owCM79wAW2vMiM/s1600/IMG_7630.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"213\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEggPxRFnAsiMhaQeO2MW59CAtuDz4_x8NucSa5QiCKxKLNv3zq_wtvum_ahdukCZpPV7qkDoYRoPrMLfEKnksTiRIqwSektdzl_OyAuTg1otzvs3kHNLpCExEJ5hRTV9owCM79wAW2vMiM/s1600/IMG_7630.JPG\" width=\"320\" /></a></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"tr-caption\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Chalani z OZ Hradiská osádzajú tabuľu</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgHeQZrr7vdQdK-zRUYT1fgRHEc82UsbhZFey6QLVz0dPgn914HXcs8mCFUmfizzXXtFMKwVj917OyR_dKc-xSiDFhQ62EJuMHaoVu7uqQuSGZcLJlQpnQfZt2FohpmQLvxwJIKRL_nB1A/s1600/P4050864.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgHeQZrr7vdQdK-zRUYT1fgRHEc82UsbhZFey6QLVz0dPgn914HXcs8mCFUmfizzXXtFMKwVj917OyR_dKc-xSiDFhQ62EJuMHaoVu7uqQuSGZcLJlQpnQfZt2FohpmQLvxwJIKRL_nB1A/s1600/P4050864.JPG\" width=\"240\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi_fn8fQtqAwk2xUaSrIamp9IC1E9W0jWFHWNnIAXB0lzw-rgqwXxzVb9nvBeAbkQDeTx-F9JKUZhkPFQ_P9raeMrqZ6TEhWSRADlbkzkS5P_-vlY0Kg_vqvoRDUFUCI2jSOvn6py4ZVXE/s1600/P4050874.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi_fn8fQtqAwk2xUaSrIamp9IC1E9W0jWFHWNnIAXB0lzw-rgqwXxzVb9nvBeAbkQDeTx-F9JKUZhkPFQ_P9raeMrqZ6TEhWSRADlbkzkS5P_-vlY0Kg_vqvoRDUFUCI2jSOvn6py4ZVXE/s1600/P4050874.JPG\" width=\"311\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: center;\"><tbody>\n<tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg3tmLv3qxVnLv6MSXPwDwuuotHXw_-EkxChkjikIaT0Ogi_CNz7OJ2ye73dwfWHcEnRDx37Yc8lhj7WN04QxgHsW22lhvyTyX7amNlUNcD36EMzmDbXryj5G_eY-m23AgWwILueldrSu4/s1600/P4050873.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"240\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg3tmLv3qxVnLv6MSXPwDwuuotHXw_-EkxChkjikIaT0Ogi_CNz7OJ2ye73dwfWHcEnRDx37Yc8lhj7WN04QxgHsW22lhvyTyX7amNlUNcD36EMzmDbXryj5G_eY-m23AgWwILueldrSu4/s1600/P4050873.JPG\" width=\"320\" /></a></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"tr-caption\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Antonín Lacko ukazuje svoju kresbu hrádku, ktorú sme dali aj na tabuľu</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<br />\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: center;\"><tbody>\n<tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhhO9xVNMSbjXSDKa5H4Np9Yqv5BK3AxFH3eoEJRQyLC3QbaP6JyyWDZP-6akgr11d2Hb0mdfKbgV3cRJ95G-T_sduAzF8GFjHah0QfIaTbtNRwiGdmEna9XStq-M0_SjS4NyNzIpJF6qM/s1600/P4050903.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhhO9xVNMSbjXSDKa5H4Np9Yqv5BK3AxFH3eoEJRQyLC3QbaP6JyyWDZP-6akgr11d2Hb0mdfKbgV3cRJ95G-T_sduAzF8GFjHah0QfIaTbtNRwiGdmEna9XStq-M0_SjS4NyNzIpJF6qM/s1600/P4050903.JPG\" width=\"232\" /></a></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"tr-caption\" style=\"text-align: center;\">zľava &nbsp;Jozef Moravčík, Štefan Meliš, Gašpar Zemančík</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjijh209ZiqtkRqFNSEO0tFhbzhupvmrs7u6KUIjXo5jT_esaUa5XlfYwFbQpEwh0EQarZNzz138GBGYquxzQB0KuYJ-RNF-0rVBiKL_DkP8J_a9AD_vp-xuKka6CU7ZmBY9NQ7KC4RH-k/s1600/P4050928.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"172\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjijh209ZiqtkRqFNSEO0tFhbzhupvmrs7u6KUIjXo5jT_esaUa5XlfYwFbQpEwh0EQarZNzz138GBGYquxzQB0KuYJ-RNF-0rVBiKL_DkP8J_a9AD_vp-xuKka6CU7ZmBY9NQ7KC4RH-k/s1600/P4050928.JPG\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: center;\"><tbody>\n<tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgqyYbS7oM3sK2LeWmfwBLCbPGCCYVjD25antt1wMJjIv0AHSxMyL9rQFtnjZr-9LwTYfShq2Togm4iIgAkMiFdOGveJtKZhOLR4jo0fJGHo88fnJN8NFQz1AJCWO6jkF-B78QfwrX4nVA/s1600/P4050931.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"248\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgqyYbS7oM3sK2LeWmfwBLCbPGCCYVjD25antt1wMJjIv0AHSxMyL9rQFtnjZr-9LwTYfShq2Togm4iIgAkMiFdOGveJtKZhOLR4jo0fJGHo88fnJN8NFQz1AJCWO6jkF-B78QfwrX4nVA/s1600/P4050931.JPG\" width=\"320\" /></a></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"tr-caption\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Novinári spovedajú archeológa Jozefa Moravčíka</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: center;\"><tbody>\n<tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEipHcLC8J5PGRkCTpCG8BbBwVquq7bRZnFCh05xDqHIYrHAHzM2M0ejP5jpIBsAKzdYcHc-M0a3QMgdnHVBxI6f8c1DfPaHmRvacyZ7zradkcvNEK2l3UncYJfvqTT_Q7QmXfANImrHkUo/s1600/P4050935.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"240\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEipHcLC8J5PGRkCTpCG8BbBwVquq7bRZnFCh05xDqHIYrHAHzM2M0ejP5jpIBsAKzdYcHc-M0a3QMgdnHVBxI6f8c1DfPaHmRvacyZ7zradkcvNEK2l3UncYJfvqTT_Q7QmXfANImrHkUo/s1600/P4050935.JPG\" width=\"320\" /></a></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"tr-caption\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Tabuľa</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg3yowLOyOVU91k__kDzE17R47aYuObJCgoJDz4LoRdlPddJhqhBUGGhi5ckTvOU03kOHZcugc836pPfW4RxNZk4S8Rlphksge8F2piZIpMpDQ_Ig5vMx5O7cUIiRLw44cBbJrtTMOrsps/s1600/IMG_7640.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg3yowLOyOVU91k__kDzE17R47aYuObJCgoJDz4LoRdlPddJhqhBUGGhi5ckTvOU03kOHZcugc836pPfW4RxNZk4S8Rlphksge8F2piZIpMpDQ_Ig5vMx5O7cUIiRLw44cBbJrtTMOrsps/s1600/IMG_7640.JPG\" width=\"213\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjNXkp7jSsboLnKpfnoGzx1v_VSa7wAXsc-bpLQaB0UshOIvJSn3sdS3z-IBXvmrxNFEcAl8TnroFQNBt4Yjix22zB1ouMaLUQUI_q4-XAmuiMM8xl5STQ5kxiW6KW5jKOp1JzWDKSa33s/s1600/IMG_7647.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"213\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjNXkp7jSsboLnKpfnoGzx1v_VSa7wAXsc-bpLQaB0UshOIvJSn3sdS3z-IBXvmrxNFEcAl8TnroFQNBt4Yjix22zB1ouMaLUQUI_q4-XAmuiMM8xl5STQ5kxiW6KW5jKOp1JzWDKSa33s/s1600/IMG_7647.JPG\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: center;\"><tbody>\n<tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg0PJYEGAVHY8w2f2uFj6xiRe7383nkH7yYRCvT0BXLxGSxcuxuguluMChjIzjKCkcHtPtv79DRvtuimqYygj0AB-v7DcwOkOpGi8DzThG-6fkqXbW_U9yMM_dz-ewUG_y1m8Agb-S-oEg/s1600/1378601_842480682435349_1920820009_n.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"240\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg0PJYEGAVHY8w2f2uFj6xiRe7383nkH7yYRCvT0BXLxGSxcuxuguluMChjIzjKCkcHtPtv79DRvtuimqYygj0AB-v7DcwOkOpGi8DzThG-6fkqXbW_U9yMM_dz-ewUG_y1m8Agb-S-oEg/s1600/1378601_842480682435349_1920820009_n.jpg\" width=\"320\" /></a></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"tr-caption\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Stanislav Miko a Štefan Meliš nám odovzdávajú Čestné uznanie</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<br />\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\nNa miesto nás prišlo podporiť viacero významných hostí. Objaviteľ hrádku Zlatý kôň, pán Štefan Meliš spolu s takmer všetkými členmi archeologického krúžku v Považskej Bystrici (páni Olšovský, Zemančík, Janech, Miko), archeológ Jozef Moravčík, ktorý krúžok v minulosti viedol, archeologička Považského múzea v Žiline Andrea Slaná, archeologička KPU Žilina Katarína Vlaszatá, archeológ Peter Schreiber, objaviteľ obetiska pán Kondrčík, v neposlednom rade kelti z Havránku - združenie Vae Victis &nbsp;a mnoho ďalších &nbsp;zaujímavých hostí. Po prvý krát naše osádzanie tabule neuniklo ani zástupcom médií.</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\nAko prvú sme osadili informačnú tabuľu pod hradiskom Zlatý kôň. Spoluorganizátor pán Štefan Žilovec nám vyšiel v ústrety jednak vybavením potrebných súhlasov od majiteľov pozemkov, ale aj vytvorením (vyčistením) miesta, na ktorom sme tabuľu osádzali, a zabezpečením &nbsp;nákladného auta, ktoré obe tabule vyviezlo do ťažko dostupného terénu.</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: center;\"><tbody>\n<tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiRrmGTqWi5olGH4A1VHgj6A3JTclPyXTMBFIkCSTKBRPF_AZXsIm8sfUydqGMZbQRIb-wRa1Ytd2v8Om6b33Qd1XdngJADzgoLzEtMz7xmimVHptlvpMcjSaY5YkeSmAppXU_oMZmM_kQ/s1600/IMG_7641.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"213\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiRrmGTqWi5olGH4A1VHgj6A3JTclPyXTMBFIkCSTKBRPF_AZXsIm8sfUydqGMZbQRIb-wRa1Ytd2v8Om6b33Qd1XdngJADzgoLzEtMz7xmimVHptlvpMcjSaY5YkeSmAppXU_oMZmM_kQ/s1600/IMG_7641.JPG\" width=\"320\" /></a></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"tr-caption\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Na hrádku Zlatý kôň</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjAeLfTL-e5ErsM2VZBuukH2mbhXSswoCayvLtmWd-Ezbz5hId0p4Dy5KA-bD6SxGKbEudcIVvZophl66y2fTlemEHyJzPalVO34jnkJ0-TnmJKNZf4994vs0I2KV3u71Faoj3ctrNSD58/s1600/SAM_3895.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"240\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjAeLfTL-e5ErsM2VZBuukH2mbhXSswoCayvLtmWd-Ezbz5hId0p4Dy5KA-bD6SxGKbEudcIVvZophl66y2fTlemEHyJzPalVO34jnkJ0-TnmJKNZf4994vs0I2KV3u71Faoj3ctrNSD58/s1600/SAM_3895.JPG\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\nPriamo na mieste už naši chalani presne vedeli čo majú robiť, takže o pár minút bola tabuľa osadená. Pri jej odhalení nám najskôr objaviteľ hrádku Štefan Meliš porozprával o tom, ako sa mu podarilo hrádok nájsť a dozvedeli sme sa od neho niekoľko povestí, viažucich sa k hrádku. Potom nás archeológ Jozef Moravčík fundovane oboznámil s najzaujímavejšími nálezmi z hrádku a porozprával nám o púchovskej kultúre.<br />\n<br />\nNásledne sme chceli pristúpiť k samotnému odhaleniu tabule, keď o slovo požiadal pán &nbsp;Stanislav Miko, ktorý v mene archeologického krúžku v pov Bystrici a OZ Pamäť a úcta odovzdal nášmu združeniu čestné uznanie za našu prácu. Povedal pritom okrem iného, že nás považujú za dôstojných pokračovateľov v činnosti archeologického krúžku. Slová pána Mika a odovzdané čestné uznanie nás veľmi potešili a zároveň povzbudili k ďalšej práci. Ďakujeme.<br />\n<br />\nPo tom už nasledovalo samotné \"požehnanie\" tabule od Čenda Žreca kvalitnou medovinou a jej odhalenie.</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\nPo ohliadke &nbsp;hrádku Zlatý kôň sme sa postupne presunuli na obetisko Uhliská.<br />\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgdbtbaf0QgqRWgmGUzWm6H8PckuT42PMm_IXETDz_yk_mQAT5xE47IhV-LRmR-lGPCLuLkWxrW_ulz38YHjTBfQN0g3XYCUw17o1ZoFjlmZMaU5kxEDdK5SeGsqOeeY3nO58w4sLCbhqc/s1600/Prosn%25C3%25A9+mapka.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"193\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgdbtbaf0QgqRWgmGUzWm6H8PckuT42PMm_IXETDz_yk_mQAT5xE47IhV-LRmR-lGPCLuLkWxrW_ulz38YHjTBfQN0g3XYCUw17o1ZoFjlmZMaU5kxEDdK5SeGsqOeeY3nO58w4sLCbhqc/s320/Prosn%25C3%25A9+mapka.jpg\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: center;\"><tbody>\n<tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjR2nX_q6RbiiXnI5QiXAFTNypo1bPif1E_AsQjQbwbswKvDZP0FmQsJ80oV4IdJrGobhRrhEOizXZ7Hv0z2fNOdhdsFcSRCyz585Om9sM_jSHKW4OsnynMd_5QZ3Fpr6NUg0m6zCBrgN0/s1600/SAM_3896.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjR2nX_q6RbiiXnI5QiXAFTNypo1bPif1E_AsQjQbwbswKvDZP0FmQsJ80oV4IdJrGobhRrhEOizXZ7Hv0z2fNOdhdsFcSRCyz585Om9sM_jSHKW4OsnynMd_5QZ3Fpr6NUg0m6zCBrgN0/s1600/SAM_3896.JPG\" width=\"240\" /></a></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"tr-caption\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Tí šťastnejší mali luxusný odvoz na Uhliská. Sami vidíte ten spokojný výraz...</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: center;\"><tbody>\n<tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgxegthLKLlQTbqPVgssGSigHTSfInJ76zn7tE6aO_Guf31HhhCPixZhppc9SLmjGGmidFxPV53Tn2gfPUahc3iYXQ1MOIBsB6HHzOVyYD-F9ofQm6pCQuT2d10BqUVt6robGfaNpO40WM/s1600/IMG_0924.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"240\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgxegthLKLlQTbqPVgssGSigHTSfInJ76zn7tE6aO_Guf31HhhCPixZhppc9SLmjGGmidFxPV53Tn2gfPUahc3iYXQ1MOIBsB6HHzOVyYD-F9ofQm6pCQuT2d10BqUVt6robGfaNpO40WM/s1600/IMG_0924.JPG\" width=\"320\" /></a></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"tr-caption\" style=