ss=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhuVdZCOsCsWB4i6P03PtFabVYwMDN_F-MUFJ72gbT_C_IL7gCKXod9twKWRNJ_8rEY4NsAYsElB0nIwRw9qh-zb-GQO3UrIaFo-woL9WX7Bc3EJ5tTrLbQ4OW2kiOnu3SHq1AEABHV_3s/s1600/10155602_666980330029181_6756902011689489353_n.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhuVdZCOsCsWB4i6P03PtFabVYwMDN_F-MUFJ72gbT_C_IL7gCKXod9twKWRNJ_8rEY4NsAYsElB0nIwRw9qh-zb-GQO3UrIaFo-woL9WX7Bc3EJ5tTrLbQ4OW2kiOnu3SHq1AEABHV_3s/s1600/10155602_666980330029181_6756902011689489353_n.jpg\" width=\"240\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: center;\"><tbody>\n<tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiwJIkIEIGQTPo-qHO4M89s_GMhKmnbDscANcSqcNJPeTZ71v-262_gA-WoaSdPBByfzeBMqgKwgfofJoRnDxpQQBPU1WEY3KQUYKbQl7U0gSMomuTm6OA37MkDIgPq41PI_foqIMV1jNs/s1600/SAM_3933.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiwJIkIEIGQTPo-qHO4M89s_GMhKmnbDscANcSqcNJPeTZ71v-262_gA-WoaSdPBByfzeBMqgKwgfofJoRnDxpQQBPU1WEY3KQUYKbQl7U0gSMomuTm6OA37MkDIgPq41PI_foqIMV1jNs/s1600/SAM_3933.JPG\" width=\"240\" /></a></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"tr-caption\" style=\"text-align: center;\">kelti boli mocní muži</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgq_LcElRZ98gmJT_8RS3Z9WFXwVhx4V-e1Y0JpQml5EWq2sF62_iahk51aAKNwRNxEJI4ekEIBCQVk2t4r5cNa62tJUPduC3LyplqoWZNItF1BmdPQs1Y_auk-Mbm73whm9hODXY8X7VE/s1600/10250263_666980413362506_3872574611040933596_n.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"240\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgq_LcElRZ98gmJT_8RS3Z9WFXwVhx4V-e1Y0JpQml5EWq2sF62_iahk51aAKNwRNxEJI4ekEIBCQVk2t4r5cNa62tJUPduC3LyplqoWZNItF1BmdPQs1Y_auk-Mbm73whm9hODXY8X7VE/s1600/10250263_666980413362506_3872574611040933596_n.jpg\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiFWt_kacrucAVyBOgcgysAy-Zsi-9klNBmMdUPzNwTJqk0dWu2gfr-aXgCiwXgDyg7uv4JeNa457prGu2-_vUFKYjD8MclRxnjSWV70svpgv6oas1RdOBJvLOgOvBwR6_WH9nsXczM4FY/s1600/SAM_3936.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"240\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiFWt_kacrucAVyBOgcgysAy-Zsi-9klNBmMdUPzNwTJqk0dWu2gfr-aXgCiwXgDyg7uv4JeNa457prGu2-_vUFKYjD8MclRxnjSWV70svpgv6oas1RdOBJvLOgOvBwR6_WH9nsXczM4FY/s1600/SAM_3936.JPG\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: center;\"><tbody>\n<tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgpUjSFhxDT3EDJnegwgLKBgnoTvIz-jTuD9nGAOqHmvyXKjjP_ygR-xft9MgpX_506FuVz3HOjyJ4iwZeNCOqfE2VN4LZjv_VkW3ld318cV9FmdAaOrZjO513oH6xeiEvsUKmi7C5YRSM/s1600/SAM_3953.JPG\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"240\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgpUjSFhxDT3EDJnegwgLKBgnoTvIz-jTuD9nGAOqHmvyXKjjP_ygR-xft9MgpX_506FuVz3HOjyJ4iwZeNCOqfE2VN4LZjv_VkW3ld318cV9FmdAaOrZjO513oH6xeiEvsUKmi7C5YRSM/s1600/SAM_3953.JPG\" width=\"320\" /></a></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"tr-caption\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\